        "description": "Welcome to the ultimate NFL and NFLPA-licensed VR experience. \nTake charge as the quarterback, orchestrating game-winning plays, or step up as a linebacker, shutting down your opponents' drive to the end zone in single-player mode.\n\n{1301379194198354}\n\n# 🏈 Squad up in the Sandbox\n\nMeet new friends off the field in the sandbox where you can sharpen your skills both on offense and defense. Loaded with mini-games, it’s your time to show your crew who’s really the GOAT.\n\n{498103399949103}\n\n# 🏈 Your HQ\n\nTaking inspiration from the best facilities in the NFL, the state-of-the-art sports complex is your place to check out the trophies you’ve collected, get the latest news, sign up for tournaments, and catch up with your teammates.\n\n{547014231489427}\n\n# 🏈 Look good, feel good\n\nWith a new level of personalization, you can now customize your avatar’s movements and appearance on the field, lacing them up in gear that will stand out from the crowd. You want to look good when you score, and now you can.\n\n{1133802798461178}\n\nThis year, the game has changed. Are you ready to make this your era?\n\n",
